* Standards axis — 0 hard violations, 3 minor judgement-call smells. Spec axis — 2 partial/missing ACs (`pnpm build` unverified, manual browser smoke check substituted with static reasoning) and 1 implemented-but-wrong finding (the commit's factually incorrect claim that leftover Radix packages are transitive, when they're actually direct, unused dependencies).", "summary": "Reviewed issue #38's diff (origin/epic/28-refactor-ui-base-ui-shadcn...HEAD) via /code-review; verdict is issues_found because the closing-verification commit factually mischaracterizes two leftover Radix packages as transitive when they're direct/unused, and two acceptance criteria (pnpm build succeeding, real-browser manual smoke check) are formally unmet despite honest disclosure."}</result>
